# Credentials: never tracked. This repo shipped .env from 28 Feb 2026 until 18 Oct 2026;
# measured on 18 Oct it held only Supabase project id, publishable key and URL (the
# publishable key is public by design), and no commit in this repository ever held a Stripe
# key. The rule stands because the next builder can make that mistake, not because this one did.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Build output that must never be committed. A tarball inside the repository is how two
# different 1.3.0 artifacts get shipped, one of them codeless.
*.tgz
*.egg-info/
